empty: input is empty: expected a bracket value
only_bom_and_spaces: input is empty: expected a bracket value
unclosed_list: unexpected end of input at line 2, column 6: list opened at line 1, column 1 is not closed
unclosed_string: unexpected end of input: string starting at line 2, column 1 is not closed
unmatched_close: unexpected '}' at line 1, column 4: no list is open
trailing_data: trailing data at line 1, column 5: only one top-level value is allowed
missing_comma: unexpected character '2' at line 1, column 6: expected ',' or '}'
unexpected_unicode: unexpected character 'ж' at line 1, column 5: expected ',' or '}'
value_after_list: unexpected character '{' at line 1, column 6: expected ',' or '}'
atom_with_brace: unexpected '}' at line 1, column 6: no list is open
invalid_utf8_string: invalid UTF-8 in quoted string starting at line 1, column 2
invalid_utf8_value: invalid UTF-8 in value starting at line 1, column 4
invalid_escape: invalid escape at line 1, column 5: expected four hex digits after `"\`
unfinished_escape: invalid escape at line 1, column 5: expected four hex digits after `"\`
